            "review_title": "Review at Lily's Baradise and Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Pam W\nDarwin18 contributions\n0\nFantastic night of great Live Music from Perfect Jive Duo at Lily's Baradise and Restaurant in Vung Tau.\nMar 2020\nWhat a great night of Live music from Perfect Jive Duo. Their music was a very Professional compilation of selected music for International Womens Day. Dancing was encouraged and the night was brilliant. Leo's Authentic Italian menu was excellent as usual. .however, he is in the process of improving his selection even more so a few adjustments are pending, Thanks owner, Rob for yet another night of terrific music, good fun and lovely staff at Lily's Baradise Restaurant and Bar. Especially loved the touch of single rose for every Awesome Woman who attended last night. Perfect.!!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 9, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
