            "review_title": "Review at Lily's Baradise and Restaurant",
            "review_text": "eytanin\nNew York City, New York275 contributions\n0\nDo not bather!\nOct 2019\nwe visited the place when the half-final game of the rugby world cup took place. we watched the big screen while ordering food and drinks\nthe drinks appear by a blink of the eye. the food (simple order) failed to arrive after a long time. a lady that looks as a manageress, appeared and re-confirmed the order. \nthe game ended. no food! then the waitress came and declared: \"10 minutes\"\nHA HA HA!\nwe saw the owner moving around only approaching the regulars. so if you are not one of them' DO NOT BOTHER VISITING THE PLACE! no wonder the place is mostly empty.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 22, 2020",
