            "review_title": "Review at Lily's Baradise and Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Martin n\nSydney, Australia305 contributions\n2\nNEW OWNER, NEW NAME: \"LILY'S BARADISE\"!\nFeb 2020\nLong-time Vung Tau visitors and locals will remember this venue as Tommy's, but that's all changed now - with new owner Rob and his Vietnamese-speaking Italian executive chef Leonardo working hard to present Lily's Baradise bar and restaurant as an all-new experience by progressively redesigning the venue and its offerings.\nIt's relatively early days for the new venture, but many local residents (Vietnamese and foreigners alike) have already visited - and the Vung Tau Hash House Harriers have made it their preferred venue for Sunday afternoon pre- and post-run gatherings.\nPlenty of shade, plenty of space - and just a short walk from Front Beach ferries, parks and other attractions!\n\"Lily's\" is highly recommended for everything from morning coffee to lunch and/or dinner (and drinks!), and not forgetting karaoke, live music, etc. Ask Rob, Leonardo or any of the bar staff for details!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 13, 2020",
